<title>CHILE: Chile's Edelnor Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Chile's Edelnor Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power generator Compania Electrica del Norte Grande, Edelnor, reported the following results in the first quarter.</p>
<p>		     Q1 1997	  Q1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	  3.22     loss  1.55</p>
<p>Oper profit	 1.67     loss  1.30</p>
<p>Non-oper profit   2.29     loss  0.25</p>
<p>Total revenues   11.45	    11.30</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>Southern Electric owns 65 percent of Edelnor. ((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212))</p>
</text>
